span></span></a></li><li><a data-game_id=\"2954180\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fstelladevt.itch.io%2Fspooktober-jam&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://stelladevt.itch.io/spooktober-jam/community\"><svg height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://stelladevt.itch.io/spooktober-jam/devlog\"><svg height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/2954180/spooktober-jam\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">The Spooktober Visual Novel Jam!</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_2778804\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://stelladevt.itch.io/spooktober-jam/purchase\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><a href=\"https://spooktobervnjam.com\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Looking for this year&#x27;s competition page? Click here</a>!&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"custom-announcement\">\r\n<p>An appeal from Stella, creator of the Spooktober Visual Novel Jam!&nbsp;(this visual novel, but also the competition.)</p>\r\n<p><em>Make&nbsp;Visual Novels and the Spooktober Visual&nbsp;Novel Jam Competition exist to push visual novel creators to new heights.&nbsp; &nbsp;We rely heavily on our sponsors and contributors to afford running the competition and conducting our work for visual novels and narrative games.</em><em><br></em></p>\r\n<p><em>Your contributions to this visual novel will be used to fund the prize pot and special categories for our upcoming competitions.&nbsp; These special categories&nbsp;encourage and challenge creators to develop&nbsp;new techniques and technologies in a competitive environment, which we then learn from and share.&nbsp;</em><strong></strong></p><p>If you enjoyed a visual novel made for Spooktober, or if you&#x27;ve participated in the competition, please consider contributing to help us keep the event going!</p>\r\n<p><strong>Lets make awesome visual novels together!</strong><br></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<h2>\uD83C\uDF4B Help Lime, Cherry, Plum, and Lemon in a Jam-Packed Adventure! \uD83C\uDF52</h2>\r\n<p>(ugh, who wrote this???)</p>\r\n<p>Hello, dear Reader!&nbsp; It&#x27;s me, your informative narrator and guide to Northbridge!&nbsp; The spookiest time of the year is upon us once again, and our favorite digital mascots are up to something new!&nbsp; They&#x27;ll be participating in the Spooktober Visual Novel Jam, the Halloween themed visual novel competition!</p>\r\n<p>Meet Lime, the organized (and maybe just a tiny bit stressed) mastermind behind the Spooktober Visual Novel Jam! While Lime keeps the competitive chaos in check, her morally dubious sister, Lemon and their friends Cherry and Plum are diving headfirst into the fun (and maybe a little frustration) of creating the spookiest, kookiest visual novels ever.</p>\r\n<p>But they can’t do it alone, Reader&mdash;they need your help! Will you guide Cherry’s passion, Plum’s creativity, and Lemon’s&hellip; uh, let’s call them unique ideas, toward greatness? Or will you choose violence and doom them at every opportunity? Every decision you make shapes their stories, so choose wisely&mdash;or not! After all, some of the best jams are the messiest ones.&nbsp; &nbsp;With multiple possible endings, the fate of this spooky jam is in your hands. Will it be a haunting success or a frightful flop?</p>\r\n<p>Get ready to laugh, learn, and maybe even scream with Lime, Cherry, Plum, and Lemon in The Spooktober Visual Novel Jam!.. The Visual Novel!</p>\r\n<p>Features:</p>\r\n<ul><li>Around 30,000 words.</li><li>Multiple Endings</li><li>Choices that matter</li><li>Choices that don&#x27;t matter</li><li>3 walls (We lost the other one; don&#x27;t ask)</li><li>Live2D animated&nbsp;characters&nbsp;on 3D scenes</li><li>Visual Novel Propaganda</li></ul>\r\n<p>Credits:</p>\r\n<ul><li>Scenario Written and Edited by Isla</li><li>Edited by Nai</li><li>Lemon, Lime, Cherry &amp;&nbsp;Plum designs and Live2D models by PumpkinRogue</li><li>Lemon, Lime, Cherry &amp; Plum Chibis by Teasugar</li><li>Approved by the Boss</li></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_1071108\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 1 total ratings\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"aggregate_rating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"5.0\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 100.00000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star icon-star\"></s